{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>黃大仙雙鳳街一間麵包舖，今早（28日）有大面積石屎連同假天花一同四散店內，一名26歲女顧客「中頭獎」送院。</p><p>警方表示，經調查後，拘捕麵包舖的姓林（67歲）男負責人，他涉嫌「容許物件從建築物墮下」。警員及屋宇署正跟進事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"月餅包裝上佈滿石屎碎片。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934793803042816756021.jpeg/WW6G9Xg5HtAVv0RPbZ-X9BqFtM_xEJvoNXlIzxB5SM8\"/><figcaption>月餅包裝上佈滿石屎碎片。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><p>案發在今日（28日）早上約7時54分，黃大仙雙鳳街14號一間麵包舖，有一幅面積約4米乘3米的假天花，連同石屎一同剝落，擊中一名姓郭（26歲）女顧客。傷者額頭及手臂受傷，由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><p>網上圖片可見，麵包舖內滿目瘡痍，大塊石屎從天花剝落，碎片散落一地；月餅包裝上亦佈滿石屎碎片。警員及屋宇署職員先後到場。</p><figure><img alt=\"女傷者受傷送院。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169937154961313792298653.jpeg/QUqVbxO-CK3jJ3kgoZd0KNeGLE2-F3iCT5p6UWqaelE\"/><figcaption>女傷者受傷送院。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"石屎連同假天花一同塌下。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169935028939919360460235.jpeg/AB8kaAUwGOySBmVBLq8aSW67nXobCDx3WvLWP3_y1j8\"/><figcaption>石屎連同假天花一同塌下。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙雙鳳街14號一間麵包舖，有大面積石屎連同假天花一同塌下，碎片散落一地。（慈雲山資訊交流/Coral Shum圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169923621200596992738501.png/XkehETYG10oHjCUfUtevTmYGDC8b1nOmis3AporNwKY\"/><figcaption>黃大仙雙鳳街14號一間麵包舖，有大面積石屎連同假天花一同塌下，碎片散落一地。（慈雲山資訊交流/Coral Shum圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"屋宇署職員（左）向麵包店一名男子了解。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1170014966430830592290785.jpeg/xlDlqsA1jBEocv9KZMNhhMJgX9gIM0VgDxIu2iYSLto\"/><figcaption>屋宇署職員（左）向麵包店一名男子了解。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"麵面舖一名男子在場助查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1170015079211470848570643.jpeg/P1k1VwdkfIxEAWLetknOlDuS-X2cOSaxueUziJDlM4g\"/><figcaption>麵面舖一名男子在場助查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大量石屎碎片懷疑從天花剝落。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934664668942336263579.jpeg/5U5skKD0JxPKG3AYYpgccewZtsL-FjpBWKXunn2l7p4\"/><figcaption>大量石屎碎片懷疑從天花剝落。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者受傷送院。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169937265552527360037596.jpeg/miBlJJLotzj2YfWcNodrPvu5NYkz2-rWy_ay_O72svw\"/><figcaption>傷者受傷送院。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員圍封鎖現場。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934662261280768410572.jpeg/aBbV3dRsRtHT-B9WgMgr8bLlG56WRS5ws0Z_opZGf6I\"/><figcaption>警員圍封鎖現場。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場遺下一地石屎碎片。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934668301340672521379.jpeg/JRNv9gyB78jZhQnMFuTg8-wN2xsb2b86jrZ6SKu2ekg\"/><figcaption>現場遺下一地石屎碎片。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934672357363712796043.jpeg/2oPR7tmwiudIapC6Gfu1zTSkbOuZL447KNMsaQ3TLGk\"/><figcaption>店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934675314479104841657.jpeg/JXc8oSx5w82K4BA9ZXrTPKBXe5IRyl0xi6YFfa6mBX0\"/><figcaption>店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934660650668032604218.jpeg/mB6WRcs7AUynK6zJy22nvqfqQJVmJLul2rufp_-7n6c\"/><figcaption>店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大塊石屎從天而降。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934671229095936619872.jpeg/JZzrGhyY7Q52Q2kLpx6Z4JkOE2HKfgaPGvM6qj_zOqo\"/><figcaption>大塊石屎從天而降。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934674186211328623457.jpeg/lwqas7s0kyrUM_SAPtKa-6J47NM9g9KH6zp0e846dHs\"/><figcaption>店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T06:39:32.968075+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":569,"images":15,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}